

# type(scope): what changed, imperative, ≤ 60 chars
#
# Why it changed, if not obvious. Wrap at 72 columns.
#
# Types:  feat | fix | content | style | refactor | chore | deploy | docs | demo
# Scopes: home | writing | contact | search | seo | resume | styles | deps | dev | deploy
#
# Rules: imperative ("add", not "added"), no TODO in the subject,
#        one logical change per commit. Full guide: CLAUDE.md
#
# e.g. feat(contact): route all contact through the form
#      content(writing): add post on RAG evals
